    "Definite articles: der/die/das/die; den/die/das/die; dem/der/dem/den; des/der/des/der.",
    "Indefinite and possessive articles follow ein-pattern; no plural ein; possessive stem owner, ending case/gender/number of possessed noun.",
    "Personal and reflexive pronouns distinguish mich/mir, dich/dir; third-person reflexive sich; Genitiv personal pronouns rare.",
    "Dativ plural adds n where applicable; Genitiv masculine/neuter singular usually s/es; two-way prepositions location Dativ, destination Akkusativ."
